---
// src/components/GlassDebug.astro
//
// TEMPORARY (2026-10-25): the ?glassdebug readout for the investigation into the bar's glass, which
// clears after a theme switch or a return to Safari. Rendered by the Head override on every Starlight
// page, it renders nothing and loads nothing more unless the URL carries ?glassdebug; then it loads
// glass-debug.ts, which draws the panel. Delete both files and the line in the Head override when the
// investigation is done.
---

<script>
  if (new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).has('glassdebug')) {
    void import('./glass-debug').then((debug) => debug.start());
  }
</script>
